Set GPU profile for a game

Usage:
  spela gpu set <game> [flags]

Flags:
      --clock-offset int           GPU core clock offset in MHz
      --fan-speed int              GPU fan speed percentage (0 to clear)
  -h, --help                       help for set
      --memory-offset int          GPU memory clock offset in MHz
      --power-limit int            GPU power limit in watts
      --power-mizer string         GPU power mode (adaptive, max)
      --shader-cache string        Enable shader caching (true/false)
      --shader-cache-path string   Custom shader cache path (use 'default' to clear)
      --threaded-opt string        Enable threaded optimization (true/false)
